pan begin="00:26.225" end="00:26.400">that </span><span begin="00:26.400" end="00:26.712">shit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.344" end="00:29.557"><span begin="00:27.344" end="00:27.520">Feel </span><span begin="00:27.520" end="00:27.664">it </span><span begin="00:27.664" end="00:27.848">in </span><span begin="00:27.848" end="00:28.025">your </span><span begin="00:28.025" end="00:28.460">bones </span><span begin="00:28.460" end="00:28.662">and </span><span begin="00:28.662" end="00:28.869">own </span><span begin="00:28.869" end="00:29.144">that </span><span begin="00:29.144" end="00:29.557">shit</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.681" end="00:30.288"><span begin="00:29.681" end="00:29.848">I </span><span begin="00:29.848" end="00:30.048">don't </span><span begin="00:30.048" end="00:30.288">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.694" end="00:34.574"><span begin="00:30.694" end="00:30.894">Then </span><span begin="00:30.894" end="00:31.078">I </span><span begin="00:31.078" end="00:31.294">had </span><span begin="00:31.294" end="00:31.518">this </span><span begin="00:31.518" end="00:32.190">interaction </span><span begin="00:32.190" end="00:32.462">I've </span><span begin="00:32.462" end="00:32.646">been </span><span begin="00:32.646" end="00:32.902">thinking </span><span begin="00:32.902" end="00:33.174">'bout </span><span begin="00:33.174" end="00:33.398">for </span><span begin="00:33.398" end="00:33.646">like </span><span begin="00:33.646" end="00:33.968">five </span><span begin="00:33.968" end="00:34.574">weeks</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.776" end="00:37.042"><span begin="00:34.776" end="00:34.992">Wonder </span><span begin="00:34.992" end="00:35.168">if </span><span begin="00:35.168" end="00:35.344">he's </span><span begin="00:35.344" end="00:35.688">thinking </span><span begin="00:35.688" end="00:35.887">'bout </span><span begin="00:35.887" end="00:36.090">it </span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:36.258">too </span><span begin="00:36.258" end="00:36.466">and </span><span begin="00:36.466" end="00:37.042">smiling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.544" end="00:40.537"><span begin="00:37.544" end="00:37.777">Wonder </span><span begin="00:37.777" end="00:37.968">if </span><span begin="00:37.968" end="00:38.170">he </span><span begin="00:38.170" end="00:38.433">knows </span><span begin="00:38.433" end="00:38.634">that </span><span begin="00:38.634" end="00:38.824">that's </span><span begin="00:38.824" end="00:39.065">been </span><span begin="00:39.065" end="00:39.257">what's </span><span begin="00:39.257" end="00:39.688">inspiring </span><span begin="00:39.688" end="00:40.537">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.770" end="00:44.314"><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:40.970">Wonder </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.154">if </span><span begin="00:41.154" end="00:41.354">he's </span><span begin="00:41.354" end="00:41.722">judging </span><span begin="00:41.722" end="00:41.930">me </span><span begin="00:41.930" end="00:42.125">like </span><span begin="00:42.125" end="00:42.433">I </span><span begin="00:42.433" end="00:42.626">am </span><span begin="00:42.626" end="00:42.826">right </span><span begin="00:42.826" end="00:44.314">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.658" end="00:46.020"><span begin="00:44.658" end="00:44.853">I </span><span begin="00:44.853" end="00:45.138">don't </span><span begin="00:45.138" end="00:46.020">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.904" end="00:48.487"><span begin="00:46.904" end="00:47.119">I'd </span><span begin="00:47.119" end="00:47.489">rather </span><span begin="00:47.489" end="00:47.919">tell </span><span begin="00:47.919" end="00:48.111">the </span><span begin="00:48.111" end="00:48.487">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.972" end="00:49.829"><span begin="00:48.972" end="00:49.829">Truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.829" end="00:51.537"><span begin="00:49.829" end="00:50.039">Than </span><span begin="00:50.039" end="00:50.197">make </span><span begin="00:50.197" end="00:50.397">it </span><span begin="00:50.397" end="00:50.694">worse </span><span begin="00:50.694" end="00:50.958">for </span><span begin="00:50.958" end="00:51.537">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.774" end="00:52.197"><span begin="00:51.774" end="00:52.197">You</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.405" end="00:52.981"><span begin="00:52.405" end="00:52.981">Mmm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.437" end="00:57.175"><span begin="00:53.437" end="00:53.637">If </span><span begin="00:53.637" end="00:53.813">the </span><span begin="00:53.813" end="00:54.839">sun </span><span begin="00:54.839" end="00:56.240">refused </span><span begin="00:56.240" end="00:56.450">to </span><span begin="00:56.450" end="00:57.175">shine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.226" end="01:01.698"><span begin="00:58.226" end="00:58.890">Baby </span><span begin="00:58.890" end="00:59.371">would </span><span begin="00:59.371" end="01:00.099">I </span><span begin="01:00.099" end="01:00.338">still </span><span begin="01:00.338" end="01:00.627">be </span><span begin="01:00.627" end="01:00.972">your </span><span begin="01:00.972" end="01:01.698">lover</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.267" end="01:04.609"><span begin="01:02.267" end="01:02.914">Would </span><span begin="01:02.914" end="01:03.188">you </span><span begin="01:03.188" end="01:03.466">want </span><span begin="01:03.466" end="01:03.818">me </span><span begin="01:03.818" end="01:04.609">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.609" end="01:08.919"><span begin="01:04.609" end="01:04.792">If </span><span begin="01:04.792" end="01:04.967">the </span><span begin="01:04.967" end="01:06.128">moon </span><span begin="01:06.128" end="01:06.438">went </span><span begin="01:06.438" end="01:07.482">dark </span><span begin="01:07.482" end="01:08.919">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.670" end="01:13.203"><span begin="01:09.670" en